title start
kind: research
tags: business-plan research short-video-ranking-signals
What signals decide how short videos are distributed on the main platforms
title end

section start
title start
Abstract
title end
paragraph start
Question: what signals decide how short videos are distributed. Method: industry articles on TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube. Result: all three reward measurable attention, mainly watch time and completion. Reels also weighs sends and shares and the follower relationship, while TikTok and Shorts largely ignore follower count. Limit: exact weights are not published and every source is secondary.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Introduction
title end
paragraph start
The brand posts short videos on several platforms, so this page records what each one rewards.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Methods
title end
paragraph start
Searched for 2026 explanations of each ranking system and compared them.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Results
title end
paragraph start
TikTok: sources agree that watch time and completion rate are the heaviest signals, followed by rewatches, shares, saves and comments. One source estimates watch time and completion at forty to fifty percent of the weight and says the exact weights are not published.
paragraph end
paragraph start
Instagram: a reported statement by the head of Instagram puts sends or shares per reach first, then watch time and completion, then likes per reach. Reels also reward follower relationships more than TikTok and Shorts do.
paragraph end
paragraph start
YouTube: watch time, retention and viewer satisfaction lead, and a high click rate with low retention is penalised.
paragraph end
paragraph start
TikTok and Shorts largely ignore follower count, while Reels use it on the first pass.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Discussion
title end
paragraph start
All three reward measurable attention, so design for the first seconds and for people finishing the video. The percentages are estimates and must not be used as targets.
paragraph end
paragraph start
todo: verify the main claims against official creator pages
Not done yet.
paragraph end
section end

